From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] dummy_netd: Walk getaddrinfo results through a const pointer

The loop only reads the records it sends.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 dns_proxy.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dns_proxy.c b/dns_proxy.c
index 4ebdca9..d733775 100644
--- a/dns_proxy.c
+++ b/dns_proxy.c
@@ -231,7 +231,7 @@ proxy_getaddrinfo(
 {
     struct addrinfo hints;
     struct addrinfo* res = NULL;
-    struct addrinfo* ai;
+    const struct addrinfo* ai;
     const char* host;
     const char* serv;
     int rc;
